[
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.292",
    "end": "00:00:06.294",
    "start_seconds": 4.292,
    "end_seconds": 6.294,
    "text": "So there's this very famous song."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.336",
    "end": "00:00:08.129",
    "start_seconds": 6.336,
    "end_seconds": 8.129,
    "text": "I'm sure you're all familiar with it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.171",
    "end": "00:00:10.757",
    "start_seconds": 8.171,
    "end_seconds": 10.757,
    "text": "It’s called “My Way” by Frank Sinatra."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.591",
    "end": "00:00:13.385",
    "start_seconds": 11.591,
    "end_seconds": 13.385,
    "text": "Now I love it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.426",
    "end": "00:00:17.305",
    "start_seconds": 13.426,
    "end_seconds": 17.305,
    "text": "but there's one line in that song that has always bothered me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.181",
    "end": "00:00:19.391",
    "start_seconds": 18.181,
    "end_seconds": 19.391,
    "text": "It goes like this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.809",
    "end": "00:00:22.185",
    "start_seconds": 20.809,
    "end_seconds": 22.185,
    "text": "(Sings) “Regrets,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.227",
    "end": "00:00:24.688",
    "start_seconds": 22.227,
    "end_seconds": 24.688,
    "text": "I've had a few."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:25.021",
    "end": "00:00:29.609",
    "start_seconds": 25.021,
    "end_seconds": 29.609,
    "text": "But then again, too few to mention.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:30.902",
    "end": "00:00:32.112",
    "start_seconds": 30.902,
    "end_seconds": 32.112,
    "text": "Regrets."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:32.821",
    "end": "00:00:33.989",
    "start_seconds": 32.821,
    "end_seconds": 33.989,
    "text": "I've had a few."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.156",
    "end": "00:00:38.493",
    "start_seconds": 35.156,
    "end_seconds": 38.493,
    "text": "But then again, too few to mention?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:38.952",
    "end": "00:00:40.245",
    "start_seconds": 38.952,
    "end_seconds": 40.245,
    "text": "Now hang on a second."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:40.745",
    "end": "00:00:45.208",
    "start_seconds": 40.745,
    "end_seconds": 45.208,
    "text": "I am pretty certain that Frank Sinatra had more than a few regrets"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:45.208",
    "end": "00:00:46.376",
    "start_seconds": 45.208,
    "end_seconds": 46.376,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.418",
    "end": "00:00:49.337",
    "start_seconds": 46.418,
    "end_seconds": 49.337,
    "text": "Including hanging out with shady mafiosos."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.379",
    "end": "00:00:50.589",
    "start_seconds": 49.379,
    "end_seconds": 50.589,
    "text": "So there's that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.090",
    "end": "00:00:56.094",
    "start_seconds": 52.09,
    "end_seconds": 56.094,
    "text": "But that song, and society in general,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:56.136",
    "end": "00:01:00.223",
    "start_seconds": 56.136,
    "end_seconds": 60.223,
    "text": "encourages us to minimize regret,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.265",
    "end": "00:01:03.643",
    "start_seconds": 60.265,
    "end_seconds": 63.643,
    "text": "as if they really don't have an impact on our lives."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.311",
    "end": "00:01:06.062",
    "start_seconds": 64.311,
    "end_seconds": 66.062,
    "text": "But that's just not true."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.479",
    "end": "00:01:07.814",
    "start_seconds": 66.479,
    "end_seconds": 67.814,
    "text": "For many of us,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07.814",
    "end": "00:01:10.734",
    "start_seconds": 67.814,
    "end_seconds": 70.734,
    "text": "regrets are at the core of our identity"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.775",
    "end": "00:01:13.612",
    "start_seconds": 70.775,
    "end_seconds": 73.612,
    "text": "and have a huge impact on our work,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:13.612",
    "end": "00:01:16.573",
    "start_seconds": 73.612,
    "end_seconds": 76.57300000000001,
    "text": "our relationships and how we live our lives."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18.116",
    "end": "00:01:20.452",
    "start_seconds": 78.116,
    "end_seconds": 80.452,
    "text": "I certainly have a few."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:20.493",
    "end": "00:01:22.662",
    "start_seconds": 80.493,
    "end_seconds": 82.662,
    "text": "Some aren't very important."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.079",
    "end": "00:01:25.498",
    "start_seconds": 83.07900000000001,
    "end_seconds": 85.498,
    "text": "I regret eating a box of donuts"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.540",
    "end": "00:01:28.126",
    "start_seconds": 85.53999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 88.126,
    "text": "right before my annual physical last year."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.126",
    "end": "00:01:29.294",
    "start_seconds": 88.126,
    "end_seconds": 89.294,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:30.045",
    "end": "00:01:32.213",
    "start_seconds": 90.045,
    "end_seconds": 92.213,
    "text": "Some are a little bit more serious."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:32.213",
    "end": "00:01:37.302",
    "start_seconds": 92.213,
    "end_seconds": 97.30199999999999,
    "text": "I regret not spending more time with my son after my divorce."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.012",
    "end": "00:01:42.849",
    "start_seconds": 99.012,
    "end_seconds": 102.84899999999999,
    "text": "But I have one deep regret"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.849",
    "end": "00:01:47.395",
    "start_seconds": 102.84899999999999,
    "end_seconds": 107.39500000000001,
    "text": "that goes right to the heart of what I'm talking about today."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49.981",
    "end": "00:01:52.150",
    "start_seconds": 109.981,
    "end_seconds": 112.15,
    "text": "You see,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:52.192",
    "end": "00:01:53.985",
    "start_seconds": 112.19200000000001,
    "end_seconds": 113.985,
    "text": "I'm an accidental killer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55.445",
    "end": "00:01:57.906",
    "start_seconds": 115.445,
    "end_seconds": 117.906,
    "text": "When I was a young man,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.906",
    "end": "00:02:00.784",
    "start_seconds": 117.906,
    "end_seconds": 120.784,
    "text": "I was driving home late one night"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:00.784",
    "end": "00:02:03.536",
    "start_seconds": 120.784,
    "end_seconds": 123.536,
    "text": "with my high school sweetheart, Michelle."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:04.496",
    "end": "00:02:09.334",
    "start_seconds": 124.496,
    "end_seconds": 129.334,
    "text": "And I was paying more attention to her than I was to my driving."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.835",
    "end": "00:02:13.129",
    "start_seconds": 130.835,
    "end_seconds": 133.129,
    "text": "And I went off the road,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.129",
    "end": "00:02:14.923",
    "start_seconds": 133.129,
    "end_seconds": 134.923,
    "text": "and I hit a telephone pole."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:16.466",
    "end": "00:02:17.717",
    "start_seconds": 136.466,
    "end_seconds": 137.71699999999998,
    "text": "And she died."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:20.011",
    "end": "00:02:23.014",
    "start_seconds": 140.011,
    "end_seconds": 143.014,
    "text": "For decades after that,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.014",
    "end": "00:02:26.351",
    "start_seconds": 143.014,
    "end_seconds": 146.351,
    "text": "there were times where I was completely overwhelmed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.351",
    "end": "00:02:30.480",
    "start_seconds": 146.351,
    "end_seconds": 150.48,
    "text": "and brought to my knees by incredible guilt,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:30.480",
    "end": "00:02:34.651",
    "start_seconds": 150.48,
    "end_seconds": 154.651,
    "text": "paralyzing shame and sorrow and regret."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.527",
    "end": "00:02:37.028",
    "start_seconds": 155.527,
    "end_seconds": 157.028,
    "text": "A lot of self-loathing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.779",
    "end": "00:02:39.823",
    "start_seconds": 157.779,
    "end_seconds": 159.823,
    "text": "Not very much self-respect."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.740",
    "end": "00:02:44.494",
    "start_seconds": 160.74,
    "end_seconds": 164.494,
    "text": "And a desperate need to do whatever I could"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.536",
    "end": "00:02:47.580",
    "start_seconds": 164.536,
    "end_seconds": 167.57999999999998,
    "text": "to pay back the life that I took."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:49.582",
    "end": "00:02:53.545",
    "start_seconds": 169.582,
    "end_seconds": 173.54500000000002,
    "text": "And for many years, I thought I was the only one in this situation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.879",
    "end": "00:02:56.131",
    "start_seconds": 174.879,
    "end_seconds": 176.131,
    "text": "I was wrong."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.340",
    "end": "00:02:58.925",
    "start_seconds": 177.34,
    "end_seconds": 178.925,
    "text": "Every single year,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:58.967",
    "end": "00:03:02.220",
    "start_seconds": 178.96699999999998,
    "end_seconds": 182.22,
    "text": "people in the US accidentally kill someone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.762",
    "end": "00:03:07.058",
    "start_seconds": 182.762,
    "end_seconds": 187.058,
    "text": "And many more are seriously injured or permanently disabled"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.100",
    "end": "00:03:11.354",
    "start_seconds": 187.1,
    "end_seconds": 191.35399999999998,
    "text": "because someone made an unintentional mistake,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.396",
    "end": "00:03:13.356",
    "start_seconds": 191.39600000000002,
    "end_seconds": 193.356,
    "text": "just like me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:14.941",
    "end": "00:03:19.446",
    "start_seconds": 194.941,
    "end_seconds": 199.446,
    "text": "We all belong to a club that we never wanted to join."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.947",
    "end": "00:03:24.743",
    "start_seconds": 200.947,
    "end_seconds": 204.743,
    "text": "And recently I found out that that club has a name."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.493",
    "end": "00:03:28.079",
    "start_seconds": 205.493,
    "end_seconds": 208.079,
    "text": "It's called the Hyacinth Fellowship."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.580",
    "end": "00:03:30.957",
    "start_seconds": 208.57999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 210.957,
    "text": "And last fall, I had the opportunity"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.957",
    "end": "00:03:35.044",
    "start_seconds": 210.957,
    "end_seconds": 215.04399999999998,
    "text": "to attend their first annual in-person gathering in Detroit."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.879",
    "end": "00:03:39.174",
    "start_seconds": 215.879,
    "end_seconds": 219.174,
    "text": "All perfectly normal, reasonable,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.215",
    "end": "00:03:42.844",
    "start_seconds": 219.215,
    "end_seconds": 222.844,
    "text": "caring people from all walks of life"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.886",
    "end": "00:03:47.390",
    "start_seconds": 222.886,
    "end_seconds": 227.39,
    "text": "coming together to try to figure out a way"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.390",
    "end": "00:03:51.978",
    "start_seconds": 227.39,
    "end_seconds": 231.978,
    "text": "to move forward and to cope through their own accidental killings."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.396",
    "end": "00:03:56.483",
    "start_seconds": 233.39600000000002,
    "end_seconds": 236.483,
    "text": "One woman I met there, let's call her Marie,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.483",
    "end": "00:04:00.528",
    "start_seconds": 236.483,
    "end_seconds": 240.528,
    "text": "she was just one year out from having had a motorcyclist"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.528",
    "end": "00:04:03.490",
    "start_seconds": 240.528,
    "end_seconds": 243.49,
    "text": "T-bone, her car, dying instantly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:04.324",
    "end": "00:04:08.495",
    "start_seconds": 244.324,
    "end_seconds": 248.495,
    "text": "And she told us that she had recently found out"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.536",
    "end": "00:04:12.332",
    "start_seconds": 248.536,
    "end_seconds": 252.332,
    "text": "that two cars had collided in that exact same spot"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.373",
    "end": "00:04:14.417",
    "start_seconds": 252.373,
    "end_seconds": 254.417,
    "text": "not long after her accident,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:14.417",
    "end": "00:04:16.544",
    "start_seconds": 254.417,
    "end_seconds": 256.544,
    "text": "and both the drivers had died."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:17.504",
    "end": "00:04:22.467",
    "start_seconds": 257.504,
    "end_seconds": 262.467,
    "text": "And she said her very first thought was,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:22.509",
    "end": "00:04:24.552",
    "start_seconds": 262.509,
    "end_seconds": 264.552,
    "text": "\"Thank goodness they both died,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.594",
    "end": "00:04:27.514",
    "start_seconds": 264.594,
    "end_seconds": 267.514,
    "text": "because then no one has to feel the guilt.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.723",
    "end": "00:04:33.019",
    "start_seconds": 268.723,
    "end_seconds": 273.019,
    "text": "And we all nodded because we knew exactly how she felt."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.562",
    "end": "00:04:38.316",
    "start_seconds": 274.562,
    "end_seconds": 278.31600000000003,
    "text": "And one of the realizations I took away with me from that gathering"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.358",
    "end": "00:04:41.528",
    "start_seconds": 278.358,
    "end_seconds": 281.528,
    "text": "is how ill-equipped we are as a society"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:41.528",
    "end": "00:04:43.404",
    "start_seconds": 281.528,
    "end_seconds": 283.404,
    "text": "to deal with regret."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.489",
    "end": "00:04:49.035",
    "start_seconds": 284.489,
    "end_seconds": 289.03499999999997,
    "text": "Now accidentally killing someone is very, very serious."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.994",
    "end": "00:04:52.705",
    "start_seconds": 289.994,
    "end_seconds": 292.705,
    "text": "But none of us are immune to regret."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.414",
    "end": "00:04:54.916",
    "start_seconds": 293.414,
    "end_seconds": 294.916,
    "text": "Maybe, as I've been talking,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.958",
    "end": "00:04:57.502",
    "start_seconds": 294.95799999999997,
    "end_seconds": 297.502,
    "text": "some of you here have been thinking about something"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.544",
    "end": "00:04:59.462",
    "start_seconds": 297.544,
    "end_seconds": 299.462,
    "text": "that happened in your life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.504",
    "end": "00:05:03.842",
    "start_seconds": 299.504,
    "end_seconds": 303.842,
    "text": "Some unintentional harm you caused someone that you truly regret,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:03.842",
    "end": "00:05:07.178",
    "start_seconds": 303.842,
    "end_seconds": 307.178,
    "text": "that you wish you could take back and fix somehow."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:08.221",
    "end": "00:05:10.098",
    "start_seconds": 308.221,
    "end_seconds": 310.098,
    "text": "The thing of it is,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:10.139",
    "end": "00:05:12.976",
    "start_seconds": 310.139,
    "end_seconds": 312.976,
    "text": "most of us don't talk about our regrets"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.017",
    "end": "00:05:14.936",
    "start_seconds": 313.017,
    "end_seconds": 314.936,
    "text": "until maybe we're on our deathbed,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:14.978",
    "end": "00:05:18.106",
    "start_seconds": 314.978,
    "end_seconds": 318.106,
    "text": "trying to own our mistakes and make amends."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.773",
    "end": "00:05:20.608",
    "start_seconds": 318.773,
    "end_seconds": 320.608,
    "text": "But by then it's usually too late."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:21.526",
    "end": "00:05:24.070",
    "start_seconds": 321.526,
    "end_seconds": 324.07,
    "text": "Or if we do talk about them,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:24.112",
    "end": "00:05:26.781",
    "start_seconds": 324.112,
    "end_seconds": 326.781,
    "text": "we often get some really bad advice."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:28.116",
    "end": "00:05:34.205",
    "start_seconds": 328.116,
    "end_seconds": 334.205,
    "text": "I remember one woman coming up to me at the funeral and saying,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.205",
    "end": "00:05:35.540",
    "start_seconds": 334.205,
    "end_seconds": 335.54,
    "text": "\"Don't blame yourself."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:35.582",
    "end": "00:05:37.125",
    "start_seconds": 335.582,
    "end_seconds": 337.125,
    "text": "This isn't your fault."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:37.125",
    "end": "00:05:39.085",
    "start_seconds": 337.125,
    "end_seconds": 339.085,
    "text": "God wanted her in heaven.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:40.879",
    "end": "00:05:44.257",
    "start_seconds": 340.879,
    "end_seconds": 344.257,
    "text": "Now I know she was trying to make me feel better,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:44.299",
    "end": "00:05:46.551",
    "start_seconds": 344.299,
    "end_seconds": 346.551,
    "text": "and I know she truly believed that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:47.176",
    "end": "00:05:49.345",
    "start_seconds": 347.176,
    "end_seconds": 349.345,
    "text": "But at that moment, all I could think was,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:49.387",
    "end": "00:05:51.055",
    "start_seconds": 349.387,
    "end_seconds": 351.055,
    "text": "\"Are you kidding me?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:52.724",
    "end": "00:05:55.101",
    "start_seconds": 352.724,
    "end_seconds": 355.101,
    "text": "But the really troubling piece of advice"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:55.143",
    "end": "00:06:00.064",
    "start_seconds": 355.14300000000003,
    "end_seconds": 360.064,
    "text": "that I got over and over and over again"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:00.064",
    "end": "00:06:03.109",
    "start_seconds": 360.064,
    "end_seconds": 363.109,
    "text": "was that I needed to forgive myself."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:04.485",
    "end": "00:06:05.653",
    "start_seconds": 364.485,
    "end_seconds": 365.653,
    "text": "Huh."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:06.279",
    "end": "00:06:07.614",
    "start_seconds": 366.279,
    "end_seconds": 367.614,
    "text": "Forgive myself."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:08.948",
    "end": "00:06:11.451",
    "start_seconds": 368.948,
    "end_seconds": 371.451,
    "text": "That is the last thing I want to do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:12.452",
    "end": "00:06:14.412",
    "start_seconds": 372.452,
    "end_seconds": 374.412,
    "text": "You see, to me,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:14.412",
    "end": "00:06:19.000",
    "start_seconds": 374.412,
    "end_seconds": 379.0,
    "text": "forgiving myself is somehow making an excuse for my failure"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:19.042",
    "end": "00:06:21.878",
    "start_seconds": 379.04200000000003,
    "end_seconds": 381.878,
    "text": "or deliberately letting myself off the hook"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:21.878",
    "end": "00:06:24.464",
    "start_seconds": 381.878,
    "end_seconds": 384.464,
    "text": "so I could feel better about me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:25.590",
    "end": "00:06:28.843",
    "start_seconds": 385.59,
    "end_seconds": 388.843,
    "text": "No, I was wholly responsible for what happened that night."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:28.885",
    "end": "00:06:30.386",
    "start_seconds": 388.885,
    "end_seconds": 390.386,
    "text": "And I always will be."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:31.429",
    "end": "00:06:34.057",
    "start_seconds": 391.429,
    "end_seconds": 394.057,
    "text": "So forgiving myself is off the table."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:35.058",
    "end": "00:06:40.480",
    "start_seconds": 395.058,
    "end_seconds": 400.48,
    "text": "But what I always needed to know was how do I move forward in a positive way?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:41.898",
    "end": "00:06:46.444",
    "start_seconds": 401.898,
    "end_seconds": 406.444,
    "text": "One thing I discovered is you can regret something"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:46.444",
    "end": "00:06:48.780",
    "start_seconds": 406.444,
    "end_seconds": 408.78,
    "text": "and hold yourself accountable for it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:48.780",
    "end": "00:06:51.074",
    "start_seconds": 408.78,
    "end_seconds": 411.074,
    "text": "but that doesn't mean you have to punish yourself"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:51.115",
    "end": "00:06:52.533",
    "start_seconds": 411.115,
    "end_seconds": 412.533,
    "text": "for the rest of your life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:54.535",
    "end": "00:06:57.372",
    "start_seconds": 414.53499999999997,
    "end_seconds": 417.372,
    "text": "You could learn from your regrets."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:57.372",
    "end": "00:07:01.417",
    "start_seconds": 417.372,
    "end_seconds": 421.417,
    "text": "You could try to transform them or try to do something good with them."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:02.418",
    "end": "00:07:05.797",
    "start_seconds": 422.418,
    "end_seconds": 425.797,
    "text": "You know, one of the best pieces of advice I ever got"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:05.838",
    "end": "00:07:09.425",
    "start_seconds": 425.838,
    "end_seconds": 429.425,
    "text": "came from a friend of mine in the form of two questions,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:09.467",
    "end": "00:07:12.261",
    "start_seconds": 429.467,
    "end_seconds": 432.261,
    "text": "and he asked me this right after the accident."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:12.303",
    "end": "00:07:15.932",
    "start_seconds": 432.303,
    "end_seconds": 435.932,
    "text": "He said, \"So, dude, this happened to you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:16.724",
    "end": "00:07:18.267",
    "start_seconds": 436.724,
    "end_seconds": 438.267,
    "text": "What have you learned?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:18.309",
    "end": "00:07:20.186",
    "start_seconds": 438.309,
    "end_seconds": 440.186,
    "text": "And what are you going to do about it?”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:21.604",
    "end": "00:07:23.398",
    "start_seconds": 441.604,
    "end_seconds": 443.398,
    "text": "Pretty harsh, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:24.399",
    "end": "00:07:26.067",
    "start_seconds": 444.399,
    "end_seconds": 446.067,
    "text": "Still, he had a point."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:26.985",
    "end": "00:07:32.115",
    "start_seconds": 446.985,
    "end_seconds": 452.115,
    "text": "But I was too overcome with sorrow and regret and shame"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:32.115",
    "end": "00:07:34.200",
    "start_seconds": 452.115,
    "end_seconds": 454.2,
    "text": "to really think it through."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:35.910",
    "end": "00:07:38.162",
    "start_seconds": 455.90999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 458.162,
    "text": "And that's the thing about regrets."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:38.705",
    "end": "00:07:40.873",
    "start_seconds": 458.705,
    "end_seconds": 460.873,
    "text": "We can try to ignore them,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:40.873",
    "end": "00:07:43.042",
    "start_seconds": 460.873,
    "end_seconds": 463.04200000000003,
    "text": "we can try to dismiss them,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:43.084",
    "end": "00:07:47.505",
    "start_seconds": 463.084,
    "end_seconds": 467.505,
    "text": "we can even let them overwhelm us and undermine our relationships"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:47.547",
    "end": "00:07:49.924",
    "start_seconds": 467.547,
    "end_seconds": 469.924,
    "text": "and our work for the rest of our lives."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:50.550",
    "end": "00:07:53.594",
    "start_seconds": 470.55,
    "end_seconds": 473.594,
    "text": "Or we can choose a different path forward."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:54.512",
    "end": "00:07:55.722",
    "start_seconds": 474.512,
    "end_seconds": 475.722,
    "text": "To own our mistakes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:55.763",
    "end": "00:07:59.642",
    "start_seconds": 475.763,
    "end_seconds": 479.642,
    "text": "to do whatever we can to help those we harmed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:59.684",
    "end": "00:08:01.352",
    "start_seconds": 479.68399999999997,
    "end_seconds": 481.352,
    "text": "and make amends any way we can,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:01.394",
    "end": "00:08:05.648",
    "start_seconds": 481.394,
    "end_seconds": 485.648,
    "text": "and somehow try to make a positive difference in the world."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:07.108",
    "end": "00:08:09.819",
    "start_seconds": 487.108,
    "end_seconds": 489.819,
    "text": "So the question then becomes, how?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:11.112",
    "end": "00:08:15.116",
    "start_seconds": 491.112,
    "end_seconds": 495.116,
    "text": "Well, for many years, I tried to do \"good works\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:15.158",
    "end": "00:08:18.995",
    "start_seconds": 495.158,
    "end_seconds": 498.995,
    "text": "in my work as a professional theater artist and in my writing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:19.037",
    "end": "00:08:22.373",
    "start_seconds": 499.037,
    "end_seconds": 502.373,
    "text": "and in my training programs on leadership and on respect."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:24.000",
    "end": "00:08:27.378",
    "start_seconds": 504.0,
    "end_seconds": 507.378,
    "text": "But looking back on it now,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:27.420",
    "end": "00:08:31.549",
    "start_seconds": 507.42,
    "end_seconds": 511.549,
    "text": "I think that all that good work I was doing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:31.549",
    "end": "00:08:34.469",
    "start_seconds": 511.549,
    "end_seconds": 514.469,
    "text": "was unconsciously disingenuous."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:35.595",
    "end": "00:08:39.724",
    "start_seconds": 515.595,
    "end_seconds": 519.724,
    "text": "You see, as good as they were, those things I was doing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:39.766",
    "end": "00:08:43.978",
    "start_seconds": 519.766,
    "end_seconds": 523.978,
    "text": "I think I was just doing them to make myself feel better about me"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:43.978",
    "end": "00:08:46.773",
    "start_seconds": 523.978,
    "end_seconds": 526.773,
    "text": "and to convince other people that I'm a good guy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:47.648",
    "end": "00:08:50.485",
    "start_seconds": 527.648,
    "end_seconds": 530.485,
    "text": "Which I am, just ask my three-month-old grandson."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:50.526",
    "end": "00:08:52.612",
    "start_seconds": 530.526,
    "end_seconds": 532.612,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:53.571",
    "end": "00:08:59.619",
    "start_seconds": 533.571,
    "end_seconds": 539.619,
    "text": "Eventually, after doing some research on something called “moral injury,”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:59.660",
    "end": "00:09:02.330",
    "start_seconds": 539.66,
    "end_seconds": 542.33,
    "text": "which is where we intentionally"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:02.371",
    "end": "00:09:07.085",
    "start_seconds": 542.371,
    "end_seconds": 547.085,
    "text": "or unintentionally break our own personal moral code,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:07.126",
    "end": "00:09:09.837",
    "start_seconds": 547.126,
    "end_seconds": 549.837,
    "text": "I realized that if I could make"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:09.837",
    "end": "00:09:12.381",
    "start_seconds": 549.837,
    "end_seconds": 552.381,
    "text": "a powerful, positive difference in the world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:12.423",
    "end": "00:09:17.220",
    "start_seconds": 552.423,
    "end_seconds": 557.22,
    "text": "in the way that Michelle would have if she had lived"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:17.261",
    "end": "00:09:20.681",
    "start_seconds": 557.261,
    "end_seconds": 560.681,
    "text": "or would have told me to do, if she could,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:20.723",
    "end": "00:09:25.144",
    "start_seconds": 560.723,
    "end_seconds": 565.144,
    "text": "then all the good I was doing would be wholly about her"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:25.144",
    "end": "00:09:27.563",
    "start_seconds": 565.144,
    "end_seconds": 567.563,
    "text": "and not about assuaging my guilt."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:28.689",
    "end": "00:09:31.150",
    "start_seconds": 568.689,
    "end_seconds": 571.15,
    "text": "So what I did was, seven years ago,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:31.150",
    "end": "00:09:35.404",
    "start_seconds": 571.15,
    "end_seconds": 575.404,
    "text": "I started an art scholarship in her name at our high school."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:36.072",
    "end": "00:09:38.991",
    "start_seconds": 576.072,
    "end_seconds": 578.991,
    "text": "She wanted to be a professional artist,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:38.991",
    "end": "00:09:43.538",
    "start_seconds": 578.991,
    "end_seconds": 583.538,
    "text": "and it feels like that's exactly what she would have wanted me to do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:53.631",
    "end": "00:09:56.134",
    "start_seconds": 593.631,
    "end_seconds": 596.134,
    "text": "And you know what I regret now?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:59.387",
    "end": "00:10:02.431",
    "start_seconds": 599.387,
    "end_seconds": 602.431,
    "text": "Is not coming to that realization sooner."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:05.476",
    "end": "00:10:10.940",
    "start_seconds": 605.476,
    "end_seconds": 610.94,
    "text": "Don't try to make the world better to make yourself feel better about you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:10.982",
    "end": "00:10:14.902",
    "start_seconds": 610.982,
    "end_seconds": 614.902,
    "text": "Change the world in the way that those you hurt would have done"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:14.902",
    "end": "00:10:18.322",
    "start_seconds": 614.902,
    "end_seconds": 618.322,
    "text": "or would have told you to do if they could."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:19.866",
    "end": "00:10:23.494",
    "start_seconds": 619.866,
    "end_seconds": 623.494,
    "text": "The woman from the Hyacinth Fellowship I told you about,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:23.494",
    "end": "00:10:28.583",
    "start_seconds": 623.494,
    "end_seconds": 628.583,
    "text": "well, she is now actively researching practical ways"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:28.624",
    "end": "00:10:32.503",
    "start_seconds": 628.624,
    "end_seconds": 632.503,
    "text": "to make our roadways safer for motorcyclists."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:33.546",
    "end": "00:10:37.925",
    "start_seconds": 633.546,
    "end_seconds": 637.925,
    "text": "And many in the group have become lay pastors and counselors and mentors"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:37.967",
    "end": "00:10:40.928",
    "start_seconds": 637.967,
    "end_seconds": 640.928,
    "text": "to those who are still working their way through"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:40.928",
    "end": "00:10:43.389",
    "start_seconds": 640.928,
    "end_seconds": 643.389,
    "text": "their own accidental killings."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:45.474",
    "end": "00:10:46.726",
    "start_seconds": 645.474,
    "end_seconds": 646.726,
    "text": "Regrets."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:47.435",
    "end": "00:10:49.312",
    "start_seconds": 647.435,
    "end_seconds": 649.312,
    "text": "We all have a few, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:50.021",
    "end": "00:10:51.397",
    "start_seconds": 650.021,
    "end_seconds": 651.397,
    "text": "And that's OK."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:53.232",
    "end": "00:10:55.026",
    "start_seconds": 653.232,
    "end_seconds": 655.026,
    "text": "You can't change your past."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:56.736",
    "end": "00:11:00.656",
    "start_seconds": 656.736,
    "end_seconds": 660.656,
    "text": "But you can use it to correct the future."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:02.366",
    "end": "00:11:03.534",
    "start_seconds": 662.366,
    "end_seconds": 663.534,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:03.576",
    "end": "00:11:07.371",
    "start_seconds": 663.576,
    "end_seconds": 667.371,
    "text": "(Cheers and applause)"
  }
]
